      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I was finally able to circumvent this via `SpawnOrientation.AlignRoomWithSpawnPoint` and the new tracking data type `TrackingDataType.Origin`. Thanks Phase!\n(If the player turns in VR and isn't in the middle of their playspace, this can still lead to issues. You might need some additional offset calculations.)",
